ference material (Claude Code SDK, AI SDK, Gemini CLI, etc.). These exist primarily so AI agents have context when working on integrations. Stripped before release.\n\n### Documentation site\n\nThe documentation site is a Bun workspace at `docs/`. To work on it locally, first ensure dependencies are installed from the repo root (`bun install`), then:\n\n    cd docs && bun run dev    # Development server with hot reload (uses --turbopack)\n    cd docs && bun run build  # Production build\n\nChanges to docs pages (`docs/content/**/*.mdx`) deploy automatically via Vercel when pushed to the configured branch.\n\nSchema generation writes to both `schemas/` (for the npm package) and `docs/public/schemas/` (for the docs site):\n\n    bun run generate-schemas\n\n---\n\n## 4. PR Conventions\n\n### Title format\n\nInclude Linear ticket numbers when applicable:\n\n```\nFixes: Sentinel drains, telemetry fixes, rollback QoL (ENG-194, ENG-193)","numLines":25,"startLine":105,"totalLines":429}},"timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:31:51.540Z"}
