{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015UkiYdZfHBGwkMtuFMCe4v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## Changes Made to `plan/merged/plan.md`\n\n**9 targeted edits** across 6 sections of the plan, incorporating findings from the implementation trial run:\n\n1. **Section b (Sources)** — Added item 5 documenting the implementation trial as a source that validated the plan.\n\n2. **Phase 0, Step 0.2** — Expanded from \"Verify clean state\" to \"Verify clean state and establish baseline.\" Added detailed documentation of two known pre-existing failures (typecheck `bun-types` resolution failure, 9 Codex binary unit test failures) with root causes, expected baseline numbers, and regression-checking technique (`git stash`).\n\n3. **Phase 1, Step 1.4** — Updated the peer dependency warning prediction. The original plan predicted Bun might warn about mismatched TypeScript versions; implementation testing confirmed no warning materialized. Added lockfile size expectations (~1,000+ additional lines, ~1,614 packages).\n\n4. **Phase 6, Step 6.1** — Added cross-reference to the pre-existing failures documented in Phase 0, so implementers aren't surprised during verification.\n\n5. **Phase 6, Step 6.2** — Added schema drift warning: `schemas/hankweave.schema.json` may change by a few lines due to unified dependency resolution. This is a one-time artifact to include in the migration commit.\n\n6. **Phase 8, Step 8.1** — Added schema diff bullet to commit message and explanatory note.\n\n7. **Section d (Conventions), item 7** — Added explanation of the different trailing-slash conventions across `STRIP_DIRS`, `INTERNAL_FILES_TO_STRIP`, and `shouldNotExist`, and why implementers must follow each script's convention rather than normalizing them.\n\n8. **Section g (Testing)** — Added new subsection \"Pre-existing test/check failures (not caused by migration)\" documenting all three known pre-existing issues with root causes.\n\n9. **Summary of Changes table** — Added row for `schemas/hankweave.schema.json` and updated totals.\n\n## Reasoning Document\n\nCreated `plan/implementations/current/updation_thoughts_and_changes.md` documenting:\n- What was changed and why (9 changes)\n- What was disagreed with or deemed non-actionable (9 sentinel/implementation observations that did not require plan changes, with reasoning for each)\n- What was intentionally left unchanged (phase structure, code instructions, Vercel config, decisions, edge cases)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":548,"cache_read_input_tokens":107515,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":548},"output_tokens":596,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"774524ca-ef80-4770-b634-d06c9d7eeed4","uuid":"d7b4be12-0077-462d-83c4-1019e827c680","timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:37:32.947Z"}
